  Interpretation:
   p < 0.05  -> DI matters JOINTLY; keep it, but you cannot attribute
               the effect to level vs. interaction separately.
   p >= 0.05 -> DI has NO detectable output effect at all. The channel
               is empirically absent (consistent with supply-constrained
               theory). Report DI output effect as zero.


